<title>BOLIVIA: SOCCER-ECUADOR BEAT CHILE 2-1 IN COPA AMERICA.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ECUADOR BEAT CHILE 2-1 IN COPA AMERICA.</headline>
<dateline>COCHABAMBA, Bolivia 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador beat Chile</p>
<p>2-1 (halftime 1-0) in a Copa America group A match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Ecuador - Ariel Graziani (32nd minute), Jose Gavica (55)</p>
<p>Chile - Fernando Vergara (51)</p>
</text>
